{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>ויתפלל</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, ואירך, ויסגוד לו וישתחו ויתפלל. ויתפלל בעדו תמיר. Teaches that Abimelech needed to ask Abraham to pray on his behalf, and this is ויסגוד לו וישתחו ויתפלל — and not at that hour alone, but always he needed his prayer, as written: ויתפלל בעדו תמיד."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {0 "The word תמיר in the second Masorah citation may be a variant reading or possibly corrupt; it is unclear whether it represents a distinct verse reference or a textual error for תמיד. Translated hyper-literally as written."}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:32.044773841Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}